68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"}],"distinction":"An urgent matter at 8:30am on 2 February remains within the blackout contact arrangement; one at 9:30am falls within the post-launch channel control. Applying the channel rule from midnight without preserving the contact arrangement would disregard the express blackout endpoint.","family":"time","formalization":null,"local_id":"r2","questions":["What makes an STR require urgent submission?","What steps beyond direct contact complete urgent reporting during blackout?"],"statement":"The selected blackout arrangement directs licensed firms with STRs requiring urgent submission to contact JFIU by the listed means until 9:00am on 2 February 2026. The source does not specify a complete filing procedure or establish that contact itself constitutes submission.","subject":"Urgent blackout contact exception"},{"assumptions":["Following implementation refers to the stated launch instant.","Resubmission is a separate obligation; its existence does not establish that the initial channel choice was compliant.","No deadline or completed-resubmission fact is inferred."],"citations":[{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"An STR emailed to JFIU after launch triggers the express resubmission obligation. An urgent blackout contact before launch is not brought within that obligation by footnote 2 alone. Whether separate guidance requires later filing remains unresolved.","family":"dependencies","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor for the identified STR falls within the circular's defined licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission occurs at or after the stated STREAMS 2 launch instant, 9:00am on 2 February 2026; supplied using an externally resolved timezone.","name":"post_launch_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission is made to JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR was submitted to JFIU, rather than merely being the subject of an inquiry or attempted contact.","name":"submitted_to_jfiu","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and submitted_to_jfiu post_launch_submission (not via_streams2))","result_type":"bool","scope":"licensed_firm"},"local_id":"r3","questions":["What deadline and procedural requirements does the promised resubmission guidance impose?","Does that guidance address reports made during blackout?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within scope, true means the express footnote 2 trigger for mandatory STREAMS 2 resubmission is satisfied; false means that trigger is not established by the supplied facts. The result does not determine whether resubmission has occurred or whether the initial submission complied.","subject":"Footnote 2 resubmission trigger"}]},"controlled-language":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Defines the actors included in licensed firms.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"reason":"Identifies STREAMS 2 and its replacement of STREAMS;