ource_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","da12aecad4e68.u25.3157","da12aecad4e68.u26.3250","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["What acts satisfy the e-Cert requirement for XML and PDF: possession, authentication, signing, or another specified use?","What time zone governs the blackout and launch times, and does following implementation in footnote 2 mean the stated 9:00am launch?","Does urgent blackout contact constitute submission, and what later filing procedure applies to reports handled through that contact?","What do the missing XML schema, prescribed PDF specifications and resubmission guidance require, including any resubmission deadline?","Which supplied references correspond to the four missing dependency identifiers?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The assessed item is one STR filing or attempted filing.","Post-launch means at or after the stated 9:00am launch on 2 February 2026; it is supplied as a Boolean because the expression language has no timestamp type.","The certificate requirement attaches to the two methods carrying footnote 3. No competing web-form certificate requirement is supported by this packet."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"distinction":"This selected control tests channel, listed format and attached certificate requirement for one post-launch filing. It does not decide XML schema compliance, registration, STR substance, timeliness or remedial resubmission. The strongest unresolved issue is the operational meaning of requiring e-Cert.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The submitting actor falls within the supplied definition of licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed STR filing occurs at or after the stated 9:00am launch on 2 February 2026, using the applicable time zone once established.","name":"post_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed STR is submitted to the JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams_2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission is an STR in XML format; this fact alone does not establish compliance with the separately provided schema.","name":"xml_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission uploads a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format.","name":"prescribed_pdf_upload","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission completes the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","name":"completed_web_form","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission satisfies the Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement in footnote 3; mere possession is not assumed sufficient.","name":"ecert_requirement_satisfied","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and via_streams_2 (or completed_web_form (and xml_submission ecert_requirement_satisfied) (and prescribed_pdf_upload ecert_requirement_satisfied)))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and licensed_firm post_launch)"},"local_id":"reading_1","questions":["What evidence establishes satisfaction of footnote 3?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, true means the individual filing satisfies the selected post-launch channel, format and attached e-Cert control: it uses STREAMS 2 and either completes its web form, submits XML with the required e-Cert, or uploads a completed prescribed PDF with the required e-Cert. False means this selected control is not satisfied; an unknown input remains unknown.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, format and e-Cert control"},{"assumptions":["The expressly timed transition provisions qualify application of the general calendar-date channel provision during the blackout."],"citations":[{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"}],"distinction":"Urgent blackout contact is a separate transitional instruction. Treating it as a post-launch alternative filing channel, or treating contact as completed filing, would add an outcome the text does not state.","family":"time","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_2","questions":["What establishes urgency, and what procedure follows direct contact?","Are reports contacted about during the blackout later subject to an express filing or resubmission instruction?"],"statement":"For STRs requiring urgent submission during the stated blackout, the text directs contact with the JFIU by the listed email, phone or fax. This includes the pre-launch hours of 2 February 2026. The packet does not establish whether contact itself completes submission; exact timestamp boundaries and that outcome are not formalized.","subject":"Blackout urgent-contact exception"},{"assumptions":["Following implementation is provisionally read against the expressly stated launch time.","The obligation is assessed separately from the initial channel control."],"citations":[{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"All STRs previously submitted through STREAMS will be migrated to STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"The text imposes a corrective duty after an off-channel submission; it does not say that later resubmission retroactively satisfies the initial channel requirement. Automatic migration of previous STREAMS records is a different arrangement.","family":"modality","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_3","questions":["When must resubmission occur, and what evidence links it to the original STR?","Does the promised guidance address blackout contacts?"],"statement":"A licensed firm that submits an STR to the JFIU through another channel following implementation must separately re-submit that STR through STREAMS 2. No completion deadline or retrospective cure of the original channel failure is specified.","subject":"Separate off-channel resubmission obligation"},{"assumptions":["Intending to submit via XML is the stated trigger, which can arise before an actual filing.","Arranging a technical test is distinct from proving that a test has passed."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU and liaise with it as soon as possible to arrange a technical test to ensure a smooth transition.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"}],"distinction":"Choosing a permitted XML format under the selected filing control does not exhaust XML-specific duties. The text requires schema conformity and prompt liaison, but does not expressly make successful test completion a filing prerequisite.","family":"dependencies","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_4","questions":["What schema version applies?","How is as soon as possible assessed, and does separate guidance impose a test-passing prerequisite?"],"statement":"Licensed firms intending to submit XML STRs must follow the separately provided JFIU schema and liaise with the JFIU as soon as possible to arrange a technical test. Missing schema contents and the contextual timing standard prevent a complete executable determination here.","subject":"XML schema and technical-test liaison dependencies"}]},"normative":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Used as actor-scope definition and transition context.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"reason":"Used as platform replacement definition and contextual background.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u1.383"},{"reason":"Used as heading for the selected STR-submission control.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u2.795"},{"reason":"Used as mandatory channel rule and effective-date evidence.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"reason":"Used as XML method with footnote 3 attachment.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"reason":"Used as prescribed PDF method with footnote 3 attachment.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"reason":"Used as web-form alternative.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"reason":"Used as registration heading, outside selected filing control.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u7.1203"},{"reason":"Registration recommendation and email process retained as separate obligation.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u8.1235"},{"reason":"Used as transitional-arrangements heading.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u9.1580"},{"reason":"Used to characterize transitional language as “should”.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614"},{"reason":"Used for blackout start and 9:00am resumption.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"reason":"Used for urgent blackout direct-contact arrangement.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"reason":"Used for launch-time wording, discontinuation and migration.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"reason":"Used for mandatory XML-schema and technical-test arrangement.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"},{"reason":"Used as inquiry contact only.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u15.2675"},{"reason":"Used for issuing-division attribution.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u16.2852"},{"reason":"No substantive text beyond issuer attribution supplied.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u18.2879"},{"reason":"Document boundary marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u19.2914"},{"reason":"Document identifier only.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u20.2919"},{"reason":"Historical webinar context.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u23.2943"},{"reason":"First fragment of referenced presentation URL; linked content unavailable.","status":"DEFERRED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u25.3157"},{"reason":"Continuation of referenced presentation URL; linked content unavailable.","status":"DEFERRED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250"},{"reason":"Footnote 2 marker linking to resubmission text.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328"},{"reason":"Separate resubmission obligation and promised guidance.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"reason":"Footnote 3 marker linking to certificate text.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563"},{"reason":"Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement for marked methods.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"The text defines “licensed firms” as “licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities”. The selected control concerns those actors' STR filings. Whether an entity is an associated entity remains a classification question.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"STREAMS 2 replaces STREAMS. The three listed methods are XML, completed prescribed PDF upload, and the STREAMS 2 web form. “Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate)” is required for the XML and PDF items marked with footnote 3; the packet does not define the technical act that satisfies it.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u1.383","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u29.3563","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"During the blackout, urgent STR matters are directed to contact the JFIU by email, phone or fax. That contact route is separate from the post-launch STREAMS 2 rule. The source separately requires re-submission of STRs made through other channels “following its implementation”; it does not expressly say that every blackout contact is an STR submission or state a resubmission deadline.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"“are required to submit” and “are required to follow” express mandatory wording. Registration and transitional arrangements use “should”; urgent contact uses “please contact”. The packet does not establish the legal consequence of each formulation beyond preserving the wording.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"One reading treats “following its implementation” as beginning at the 9:00am launch on 2026-02-02. A competing reading treats the general date “With effect from 2 February 2026” as the resubmission boundary, while retaining the blackout until 9:00am. The source does not specify a timezone.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"XML conformity depends on a separately provided JFIU schema, and the source promises resubmission guidance. The webinar presentation URL is supplied only in fragments. The contents of these materials are unavailable, so their requirements cannot be inferred.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","da12aecad4e68.u25.3157","da12aecad4e68.u26.3250","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["Does “following its implementation” mean the 9:00am launch or the calendar date 2026-02-02?","When does urgent blackout contact constitute an actual STR submission?","What technical act satisfies the Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement?","Which timezone governs the stated times?","What are the contents of the separately provided XML schema and promised resubmission guidance?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The selected control is evaluated only for a classified licensed firm and an actual STR filing.","Unknown facts remain unknown rather than being treated as false.","Footnote 3 attaches to the XML and prescribed-PDF items because those items carry the marker; the web-form item does not carry it."],"citations":[{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}],"distinction":"Operational-launch reading: “following its implementation” begins at the explicit 9:00am STREAMS 2 launch. An off-channel STR filed at or after that time triggers the separate resubmission obligation. The strongest uncertainty is that footnote 2 does not expressly define implementation by reference to the launch time.","family":"time","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor belongs to one of the classes collectively called licensed firms.","name":"is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The event is an actual STR filing to the JFIU.","name":"is_str_filing","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean event classification"},{"meaning":"The filing occurs at or after the 9:00am operational launch on 2026-02-02.","name":"at_or_after_operational_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean temporal classification"},{"meaning":"The filing is made through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel classification"},{"meaning":"The XML submission conforms to the separately provided JFIU XML schema.","name":"xml_schema_conforms","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean technical conformity assessment"},{"meaning":"The selected method is a completed prescribed PDF upload.","name":"is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean method classification"},{"meaning":"The selected method is completion of the STREAMS 2 web form.","name":"is_completed_streams2_web_form","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean method classification"},{"meaning":"The footnote 3 Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement is met for the assessed XML or PDF submission.","name":"submission_ecert_requirement_met","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean certificate-requirement assessment"}],"result":"(and via_streams2 (or (and is_xml_submission xml_schema_conforms submission_ecert_requirement_met) (and is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload submission_ecert_requirement_met) is_completed_streams2_web_form))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_licensed_firm is_str_filing at_or_after_operational_launch)"},"local_id":"operational_launch","questions":["Does the source intend the launch timestamp, including its timezone, to define implementation?","Does an urgent contact made before launch later require resubmission, and by when?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within the selected scope, true means the filing uses STREAMS 2 and one listed method, with XML schema conformity where XML is used and the footnote 3 e-Cert requirement met for XML or PDF. False means this selected control is not satisfied; it does not decide whole-firm compliance or STR timeliness.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, method and certificate control"},{"assumptions":["The general effective-date clause supplies the resubmission boundary at the start of 2026-02-02.","The blackout contact arrangement remains applicable until 9:00am, when STREAMS 2 resumes.","The selected control still requires STREAMS 2 for filings within its scope."],"citations":[{"quote":"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"following its implementation","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}],"distinction":"Calendar-date reading: the date-only effective clause governs the resubmission trigger, so an off-channel STR filed on 2026-02-02 before 9:00am could trigger later resubmission even though STREAMS 2 was not yet accepting submissions. This is less closely aligned with the explicit launch-time wording. It does not convert blackout contact into STREAMS 2 availability.","family":"time","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor belongs to one of the classes collectively called licensed firms.","name":"is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The event is an actual STR filing to the JFIU.","name":"is_str_filing","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean event classification"},{"meaning":"Gregorian calendar date of the filing.","name":"filing_date","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian date YYYY-MM-DD"},{"meaning":"The filing is made through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel classification"}],"result":"(and (>= filing_date (date 2026-02-02)) (not via_streams2))","result_type":"bool","sc