t with the JFIU by the listed email, phone or fax. This includes the pre-launch hours of 2 February 2026. The packet does not establish whether contact itself completes submission; exact timestamp boundaries and that outcome are not formalized.","subject":"Blackout urgent-contact exception"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.62bea48068a4ef796ac5903d","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.081cae9ddfc04c4ba5e404549745a535","commitment":"f02b544251272d62fcf15605b7e3de4f2ead70623c4ce8b584234e4d661d9678","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE","details":"None"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.f02b544251272d62fcf15605","order":4,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["Following implementation is provisionally read against the expressly stated launch time.","The obligation is assessed separately from the initial channel control."],"citations":[{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"All STRs previously submitted through STREAMS will be migrated to STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"The text imposes a corrective duty after an off-channel submission; it does not say that later resubmission retroactively satisfies the initial channel requirement. Automatic migration of previous STREAMS records is a different arrangement.","family":"modality","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_3","questions":["When must resubmission occur, and what evidence links it to the original STR?","Does the promised guidance address blackout contacts?"],"statement":"A licensed firm that submits an STR to the JFIU through another channel following implementation must se