,"reward":0,"root":"node.d2ff2a2cac0086fe5b2c2725","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"6444833ee91e09d7201599ca17e2b5d88748ad53cb2844df86a3a9ed0d8626f0","candidate_id":"candidate.ce3843ce40d147ecbfc507aca8aa39cb","commitment":"91c869d719c8872846f5adba4305908bb529a3b6154d6b5d105762022ecc7759","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.91c869d719c8872846f5adba","order":6,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The control evaluates an identified STR submission, with actor classification supplied rather than presumed.","The post-launch period begins at 9:00am on 2 February 2026, reading the general effective date together with the specific launch time.","Footnote 3 applies to both marked options, XML and PDF; this circular does not expressly attach it to the web form.","Technical XML schema conformity, test arrangements, registration and substantive STR adequacy are separate controls."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"distinction":"A completed web-form submission through STREAMS 2 without e-Cert can satisfy this selected control; an XML or prescribed-PDF submission without e-Cert cannot. A rival requiring e-Cert for all three methods lacks a footnote marker on option (c), so it is not proposed as an equally supported reading.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor for the identified STR falls within the circular's defined licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission occurs at or after the stated STREAMS 2 launch instant, 9:00am on 2 February 2026; supplied using an externally resolved timezone.","name":"post_launch_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission is made to JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR is submitted in XML format; this records format selection, not conformity with the separately supplied schema.","name":"xml_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified submission uploads a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format.","name":"prescribed_pdf_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified submission completes the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","name":"web_form_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement is satisfied for the identified submission; mere certificate possession is not presumed sufficient.","name":"ecert_requirement_satisfied","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and via_streams2 (or (and xml_submission ecert_requirement_satisfied) (and prescribed_pdf_submission ecert_requirement_satisfied) web_form_submission))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and licensed_firm post_launch_submission)"},"local_id":"r1","questions":["What JFIU specifications establish that the PDF is prescribed and that the e-Cert requirement is met?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, true means the identified STR satisfies the selected post-launch channel, permitted-format and attached e-Cert control; false means at least one of those requirements is unmet. This does not determine overall firm compliance.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, format and e-Cert control"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.91c869d719c8872846f5adba","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.b20429e1ce704279bf397e3b08d88eae","commitment":"c8e005eb37a38e37e6a09f740c24f06a39a10ddb619f904bc8eb08ac68c6d205","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE","details":"None"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.c8e005eb37a38e37e6a09f74","order":7,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The specific blackout arrangements qualify application of the general calendar-date channel statement.","Direct contact is not treated as proof that JFIU accepted a completed STR."],"citations":[{"quote":"will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"}],"distinction":"An urgent matter at 8:30am on 2 February remains within the blackout contact arrangement; one at 9:30am falls within the post-launch channel control. Applying the channel rule from midnight without preserving the contact arrangement would disregard the express blackout endpoint.","family":"time","formalization":null,"local_id":"r2","questions":["What makes an STR require urgent submission?","What steps beyond direct contact complete urgent reporting during blackout?"],"statement":"The selected blackout arrangement directs licensed firms with STRs requiring urgent submission to contact JFIU by the listed means until 9:00am on 2 February 2026. The source does not specify a complete filing procedure or establish that contact itself constitutes submission.","subject":"Urgent blackout contact exception"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.c8e005eb37a38e37e6a09f74","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"5a5f1c7a584df5113cbf903dbd9eedd8d6edc5a97dbe2a640593650c4c0645f7","candidate_id":"candidate.dda1fa484735460b8d4aa390e72617be","commitment":"29b224046d115582fbf223fb7c4dd5c98ac7cce593c6a5ecee1d9710a429face","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.29b224046d115582fbf223fb","order":8,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["Following implementation refers to the stated launch instant.","Resubmission is a separate obligation; its existence does not establish that the initial channel choice was compliant.","No deadline or completed-resubmission fact is inferred."],"citations":[{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"An STR emailed to JFIU after launch triggers the express resubmission obligation. An urgent blackout contact before launch is not brought within that obligation by footnote 2 alone. Whether separate guidance requires later filing remains unresolved.","family":"dependencies","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor for the identified STR falls within the circular's defined licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission occurs at or after the stated STREAMS 2 launch instant, 9:00am on 2 February 2026; supplied using an externally resolved timezone.","name":"post_launch_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission is made to JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR was submitted to JFIU, rather than merely being the subject of an inquiry or attempted contact.","name":"submitted_to_jfiu","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and submitted_to_jfiu post_launch_submission (not via_streams2))","result_type":"bool","scope":"licensed_firm"},"local_id":"r3","questions":["What deadline and procedural requirements does the promised resubmission guidance impose?","Does that guidance address reports made during blackout?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within scope, true means the express footnote 2 trigger for mandatory STREAMS 2 resubmission is satisfied; false means that trigger is not established by the supplied facts. The result does not determine whether resubmission has occurred or whether the initial submission complied.","subject":"Footnote 2 resubmission trigger"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.29b224046d115582fbf223fb","roundtrip_done":fa