in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"},{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU and liaise with it as soon as possible to arrange a technical test to ensure a smooth transition.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"}],"distinction":"A single fact such as electronic_submission would conceal the distinction between channel and format, while firm_has_ecert would conceal the submission-specific certificate requirement. XML and PDF require both the STREAMS 2 channel and the footnote 3 certificate condition. The retained text does not attach that certificate condition to the web-based alternative. The blackout is excluded from this ordinary post-launch rule.","family":"dependencies","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The entity responsible for the assessed submission is a licensed corporation, SFC-licensed virtual asset service provider or associated entity within the circular's collective definition.","name":"filer_is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of the filing entity"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission occurred at or after 9:00am on 2 February 2026 in the timezone governing the circular. This is an event-time comparison supplied as a fact because the expression language has no timestamp type.","name":"submission_at_or_after_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean temporal classification of one submission event"},{"meaning":"The assessed STR submission was made to the JFIU through STREAMS 2, rather than through another channel.","name":"submitted_to_jfiu_via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel observation for one submission event"},{"meaning":"The STR was submitted in Extensible Markup Language format. This fact does not assert conformity with the separately provided JFIU XML schema.","name":"submission_uses_xml","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean format observation for one submission event"},{"meaning":"The submission method was uploading an STR form that was completed and was in the prescribed PDF format; uploading an arbitrary PDF is insufficient.","name":"completed_prescribed_pdf_uploaded","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean assessment of the uploaded form and submission action"},{"meaning":"The submission method was completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2 for this STR.","name":"streams2_web_form_completed","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean assessment of one web-form submission"},{"meaning":"A Hongkong Post e-Cert was supplied or used for this particular XML or PDF submission in the manner required for that submission. Mere possession of a certificate is insufficient. The operational manner must be established before this fact can be supplied.","name":"hongkong_post_ecert_supplied_for_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean certificate condition for one submission event"}],"result":"(and submitted_to_jfiu_via_streams2 (or (and submission_uses_xml hongkong_post_ecert_supplied_for_submission) (and completed_prescribed_pdf_uploaded hongkong_post_ecert_supplied_for_submission) streams2_web_form_completed))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and filer_is_licensed_firm submission_at_or_after_launch)"},"local_id":"streams2.channel_method_certificate","questions":["Does the filing entity fall within one of the circular's three licensed-firm categories?","What is the submission timestamp, and what timezone governs the circular's stated transition times?","Which channel and submission method were actually used for this event?","For XML or PDF submission, what operational act involving the Hongkong Post e-Cert is required, and was that act performed for this submission?","For PDF submission, what is the prescribed form, and was the uploaded form completed?","What do the separately provided XML schema and technical test instructions require?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For an in-scope post-launch submission by a classified licensed firm, true means that the STR was submitted to the JFIU through STREAMS 2 using XML with the required Hongkong Post e-Cert, a completed prescribed PDF form with that e-Cert, or the completed STREAMS 2 web-based STR form. False means that at least one of these selected requirements was not met. An unknown input remains unknown, and an out-of-scope event receives no compliance verdict. This answers only whether the assessed submission meets the selected channel, method and footnote 3 requirements; it confers no legal approval.","subject":"Post-launch channel, submission method and method-specific e-Cert requirements"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"81ffc86edff7249a1987d5daf38664b812caeb1834cfc2d0cd62998548f6640b","candidate_id":"candidate.ac8f60eabf1041caae74f87c033f3aec","commitment":"fc565a946804e1633024b4d3dd2c19e15c59dd6c49e0968fc76d9292b6354abc","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3","order":10,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The firm is separately classified within the circular's definition of licensed firms.","Implementation for the footnote 2 trigger begins at the stated 9:00am launch on 2 February 2026.","The event history distinguishes a contact, a submission, a resubmission and an automatic record migration.","The footnote 2 trigger quantifies over submissions of this same STR: at least one qualifying post-implementation submission is sufficient to trigger the stated resubmission requirement.","The blackout urgent-contact instruction is retained as a distinct transitional instruction and is not treated as permission to use alternative channels after launch.","The retained footnote does not by itself extend the resubmission trigger to contacts or submissions occurring only during the blackout.","Triggering the requirement and subsequently discharging it are separate questions. The trigger remains historically true after a successful resubmission."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026, the operation of STREAMS will be discontinued. All STRs previously submitted through STREAMS will be migrated to STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2. The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}],"distinction":"Reviewing the submission-event model exposes a missing relation between multiple events concerning the same STR. A single off_platform Boolean would conflate urgent blackout contact, a post-launch alternative-channel submission and an automatically migrated old record. Only the second supplies the stated footnote 2 trigger. A later STREAMS 2 resubmission cannot make the original event comply with the exclusive-channel requirement, and the fact that a trigger occurred does not establish an outstanding or overdue obligation.","family":"time","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The entity responsible for the assessed STR is a licensed corporation, SFC-licensed virtual asset service provider or associated entity within the circular's collective definition.","name":"responsible_entity_is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of the responsible entity"},{"meaning":"There exists at least one actual submission of this same STR to the JFIU through a channel other than STREAMS 2 at or after 9:00am on 2 February 2026 in the governing timezone. Direct contact alone and automatic migration do not count as submissions. True requires evidence of a qualifying event; false requires an established history sufficient to rule out such an event. This externally supplied factual aggregate expresses the event quantifier absent from the formula language.","name":"report_has_postlaunch_other_channel_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean existence predicate over one STR's submission history"}],"result":"report_has_postlaunch_other_channel_submission","result_type":"bool","scope":"responsible_entity_is_licensed_firm"},"local_id":"streams2.resubmission_trigger","questions":["Does the responsible entity fall within the circular's licensed-firm definition?","What timezone governs the transition times and the report's event timestamps?","Which events concern the same STR, and which were contacts, actual submissions, resubmissions or automatic migrations?","Was this STR submitted to the JFIU through any channel other than STREAMS 2 at or after the stated launch?","If the STR required urgent submission during the blackout, did the firm contact the JFIU by the stated email, phone or fax?","What guidance did the JFIU provide about resubmission, including any deadline and the treatment of reports submitted during the blackout?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] True means that the assessed licensed firm's STR has at least one submission to the JFIU through a channel other than STREAMS 2 following implementation, so the stated requirement to resubmit that STR through STREAMS 2 is triggered. False means that no such qualifying submission exists in the established event history. Unknown or incomplete event history must not be treated as false. This answers whether the resubmission trigger occurred, not whether the firm has complied with or discharged the obligation. Separately, an STR requiring urgent submission during the blackout calls for direct JFIU contact by email, phone or fax; that instruction is not evaluated by this trigger. These proposed meanings confer no legal approval.","subject":"Resubmission trigger distinguished from blackout contact and subsequent discharge"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.fc565a946804e1633024b4d3","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"5a662bc0b96d251f733ac6f89032745e1e558323d0638807cc0938bf1f6784f0","candidate_id":"candidate.dedf47c92eb246bdb3947d8156ff1293","commitment":"a9c7e7d0e802f5a3fdf2abc23dc49efad31e81f169f0fb42af264849e7153bd8","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.a9c7e7d0e802f5a3fdf2abc2","order":11,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The firm's classification as a licensed firm is supplied as an assessed fact using the categories in the circular.","The specific launch and blackout provisions qualify the general effective-date wording: the post-launch channel test is not applied to the portion of 2 February 2026 before 9:00am.","Each assessment identifies one submission event and its actual method. Multiple submission attempts are assessed separately.","Footnote 3 requires an applicable Hongkong Post e-Cert for XML and prescribed-PDF submissions. For this proposal, the certificate fact records an e-Cert made available for the particular submission; the source alone does not establish signing, authentication or attachment mechanics.","The result covers only the selected channel, method and e-Cert conditions. It does not assess XML-schema conformity, technical testing, reporting deadlines, substantive STR adequacy or overall legal compliance."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2. Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"},{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026, the operation of STREAMS will be discontinued.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"Channel, document format, form completion and submission-specific certificate provision are separate facts. A single Boolean such as submitted_electronically would conceal both an XML or PDF submission outside STREAMS 2 and the absence of an e-Cert for those methods. Calendar-date-only scope would also wrongly extend the channel rule into the pre-launch blackout on 2 February.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The submitting entity falls within at least one of the circular's categories: licensed corporation, SFC-licensed virtual asset service provider or associated entity.","name":"submitter_is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of the submitting entity"},{"meaning":"The selected event is a submission of an STR to the JFIU, rather than account registration, a technical test or a mere inquiry.","name":"event_is_str_submission_to_jfiu","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of one event"},{"meaning":"The selected event occurred at or after 9:00am on 2 February 2026, using the governing timezone once established. Events before that instant are false, including events earlier that calendar day.","name":"event_at_or_after_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean temporal classification of one event"},{"meaning":"The selected STR submission event used STREAMS 2 as its channel to the JFIU.","name":"event_uses_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel fact for one event"},{"meaning":"The selected event submitted the STR in XML format. This fact alone does not establish conformity with the separately supplied JFIU XML schema.","name":"event_submits_xml","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean submission-method fact for one event"},{"meaning":"The selected event uploaded an STR form that was completed and used the prescribed PDF format.","name":"event_uploads_completed_prescribed_pdf","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean submission-method and form-completion fact for one event"},{"meaning":"The selected event completed the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","name":"event_completes_streams2_web_form","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean submission-method fact for one event"},{"meaning":"A Hongkong Post electronic certificate was available for the particular XML or PDF submission. Unrelated certificate possession does not establish this fact. Treating this as satisfaction of footnote 3 is conditional on the stated assumption pending clarification of required certificate-use mechanics.","name":"hongkong_post_ecert_available_for_event","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean certificate-to-submission association"}],"result":"(and event_uses_streams2 (or (and event_submits_xml hongkong_post_ecert_available_for_event) (and event_uploads_completed_prescribed_pdf hongkong_post_ecert_available_for_event) event_completes_streams2_web_form))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and submitter_is_licensed_firm event_is_str_submission_to_jfiu event_at_or_after_launch)"},"local_id":"reading.post_launch_submission","questions":["What is the submitting firm's classification, and what evidence establishes it?","What is the event's exact time, and which timezone governs the stated launch and blackout times?","Which channel and submission method did this event actually use?","For an XML or PDF event, what evidence establishes that the required Hongkong Post e-Cert was available for this submission, and what certificate-use mechanics does the JFIU require?","If the event occurred during the blackout, did the STR require urgent submission, and what direct contact with the JFIU occurred?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, the result answers whether this individual submission event satisfies the selected STREAMS 2 channel, listed submission-method and footnote 3 e-Cert conditions under the stated certificate assumption. True means the event used STREAMS 2 and either used XML with the required e-Cert, uploaded a completed prescribed PDF form with the required e-Cert, or completed the STREAMS 2 web-based STR form. False means at least one of these selected conditions failed. A false or unknown scope produces no compliance judgment, and unknown input facts must not be treated as false. This is a proposed limited model, not legal approval.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, submission-method and footnote 3 conditions"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.a9c7e7d0e802f5a3fdf2abc2","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"7b02cdcbe6d7b7ee79645f8c4f43a893f93629c9524da5cf1f02f4033bbd7eb8","candidate_id":"candidate.decdae7e9bda4341b49ac73dbeacfcb5","commitment":"8caddb7a4c29338c1d340db1c0f4b142dd25891e100708a778d21d75cd108115","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.8caddb7a4c29338c1d340db1","order":12,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The firm's classification as a licensed firm is supplied as an assessed fact using the circular's categories.","Following implementation is interpreted as at or after the stated launch instant, 9:00am on 2 February 2026, subject to establishing the governing timezone.","The assessed original event actually submitted an STR to the JFIU; a phone inquiry or other direct contact is not automatically treated as an STR submission.","Footnote 2 establishes a separate resubmission requirement, not permission to choose another post-launch reporting channel.","The supplied text does not establish a resubmission deadline or expressly extend footnote 2 to urgent blackout submissions."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2. The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026, the operation of STREAMS will be discontinued.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"}],"distinction":"A report-level Boolean such as submitted_via_streams2 could become true after resubmission and conceal the original off-platform event that triggered the obligation. Separating the original and subsequent events preserves both the initial channel assessment and the remedial requirement. It also prevents blackout contact from being classified as a post-launch off-platform submission solely because the report was later entered in STREAMS 2.","family":"dependencies","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The entity responsible for the original submission falls within the circular's defined licensed-firm categories.","name":"original_submitter_is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of the original submitting entity"},{"meaning":"The identified original event submitted the identified STR to the JFIU. Mere contact without submission does not establish this fact.","name":"original_event_submitted_str_to_jfiu","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean event-to-report and recipient relationship"},{"meaning":"The original submission occurred at or after 9:00am on 2 February 2026 in the governing timezone once established. This concerns the original event, not any subsequent resubmission.","name":"original_event_at_or_after_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean temporal classification of the original event"},{"meaning":"The original STR submission used STREAMS 2 as its channel to the JFIU. A later STREAMS 2 resubmission does not make this fact true.","name":"original_event_uses_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel fact for the original event"}],"result":"(and original_event_at_or_after_launch (not original_event_uses_streams2))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and original_submitter_is_licensed_firm original_event_submitted_str_to_jfiu)"},"local_id":"reading.resubmission_trigger","questions":["What is the original submitter's licensed-firm classification?","Was an STR actually submitted to the JFIU, through which channel, and at what exact time in the governing timezone?","Was the same STR subsequently resubmitted through STREAMS 2, and what evidence links the two events?","What guidance did the JFIU provide concerning resubmission procedure and timing?","Does JFIU guidance require urgent STRs submitted during the blackout to be resubmitted after launch?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within scope, the result answers whether the identified original STR submission triggers footnote 2's separate requirement to resubmit the same STR through STREAMS 2. True means the original event occurred at or after implementation and used a channel other than STREAMS 2. False means that specific trigger is absent. The result does not determine whether resubmission has occurred, whether an obligation remains outstanding, or whether the original event was compliant. Unknown facts remain unknown. This proposed interpretation confers no legal approval.","subject":"Historical trigger for the separate STREAMS 2 resubmission requirement"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.8caddb7a4c29338c1d340db1","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.46f8181e09494d728a20b65ce78c2b11","commitment":"27994712d6e50c0a1c05dea65064166dd43b3cd8aa9bc622ab18a6596d875987","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE","details":"None"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.27994712d6e50c0a1c05dea6","order":13,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The filing entity's membership in the circular's licensed-firm categories requires a separate assessment and is not inferred from platform use.","The specific launch and resumption provisions qualify the general effective-date wording for the post-launch assessment.","The selected event is an actual STR submission to the JFIU; registration, a technical test, direct contact and automatic record migration are separate event classifications.","Each assessed event has an identifiable submission method. Evidence from separate attempts or resubmissions is not combined to make one event satisfy the selected conditions.","Footnote 3 applies to the XML and prescribed-PDF alternatives carrying its marker. No certificate requirement for the web-based alternative is inferred from this footnote.","The source establishes a submission-related e-Cert requirement but does not establish that certificate availability alone satisfies it. Signing, authentication, attachment, certificate-holder identity and validity mechanics are not assumed.","The proposed decision concerns only the selected reporting channel, listed method and footnote 3 condition. It does not establish XML-schema conformity, completion of technical testing, reporting timeliness, substantive STR adequacy or overall legal compliance.","The blackout urgent-contact instruction and footnote 2 resubmission requirement remain separate. Resubmission does not change the original event's channel or time, and the retained text supplies no resubmission deadline."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2. Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"},{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026, the operation of STREAMS will be discontinued. All STRs previously submitted through STREAMS will be migrated to STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU and liaise with it as soon as possible to arrange a technical test to ensure a smooth transition.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"},{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2. The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}],"distinction":"The prior models already identify the relevant actors, distinguish channel from method, preserve the launch boundary and separate submission, contact, migration and resubmission events. The consequential remaining defect is the certificate relationship. Model abstraction.c8a341a59885fb7db63017bf makes certificate availability sufficient under an explicit assumption. Model abstraction.ebfcf1c1217258fc2b8613f9 instead requires supply or use 'in the manner required', but the required manner remains unspecified. The retained footnote supports a requirement for the particular submission; it does not resolve availability versus the operational act needed to satisfy that requirement. This proposal therefore withholds a complete compliance formula pending that information. It does not invent a rival signing, attachment or authentication requirement. Splitting the PDF components also prevents the file's format from concealing an incomplete form or a missing upload.","family":"dependencies","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading.certificate_relation_challenge","questions":["What evidence establishes the submitting entity's classification within the circular's licensed-firm categories?","What is the assessed event's timestamp, and which timezone governs the stated launch and blackout times?","Was this an actual STR submission to the JFIU, and which channel and method did this particular event use?","For a PDF event, which prescribed form applied, was it completed, and was that completed form uploaded?","What operational relationship between a Hongkong Post e-Cert and an XML or PDF submission satisfies footnote 3, and what evidence establishes that relationship for this event?","Do the applicable technical requirements impose certificate-holder, authorization or validity conditions, and if so, what are they?","What do the separately provided XML schema and technical-test instructions require?","If the STR required urgent submission during the blackout, what direct contact with the JFIU occurred through a listed method?","Does the same STR have any actual post-implementation submission outside STREAMS 2, and what subsequent resubmission and JFIU guidance are evidenced?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] The proposed question is whether one in-scope post-launch STR submission satisfies the selected STREAMS 2 channel, listed submission-method and footnote 3 conditions. True would mean that the event used STREAMS 2 and completed one listed method, including the submission-related Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement where XML or PDF was used. False would mean that at least one applicable selected condition failed. Neither an unknown fact nor an unknown or false scope produces a compliance verdict. Formalization is null because the retained source does not specify the certificate relationship needed to interpret the XML and PDF branches without substituting an unsupported operational assumption or an opaque satisfaction fact. No event-level truth value is assigned. This proposed meaning confers no legal approval.","subject":"Submission-specific e-Cert requirement without substituting availability or an undefined satisfaction predicate"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.27994712d6e50c0a1c05dea6","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"26eb3a9322528805dcce6c3923e429733c892dd1bd5df11aeadb9c2378b373d5","candidate_id":"candidate.9e833e112ed24d85ae3f7571ab703261","commitment":"f75383097facdc52b0ac66f7674843bb70972e244f5b0a4464c8b8e2c9a89d70","depth":1,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.f75383097facdc52b0ac66f7","order":14,"parent":"node.583a0a4d40d9fa690cc9a445","reading":{"assumptions":["The selected event is assessed separately from any later resubmission.","Licensed-firm classification uses the three source-defined classes without an additional narrower classification.","The operational launch bounds the post-launch control; the rule is not applied during the blackout.","Footnote 3 attaches to both marked methods, XML and PDF.","Unknown facts remain unknown. Certificate satisfaction requires an external assessment grounded in operational requirements; possession alone is insufficient evidence.","The formula is conditional on externally supplied technical assessments and excludes registration, technical-test liaison, STR timeliness and whole-firm compliance."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"},{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}],"distinction":"Retains the parent's channel-and-method reading while repairing its unresolved is_xml_submission reference. Footnote 2 attaches a further duty to an off-channel filing; it does not make that original filing compliant if later resubmitted. The competing hypothesis that footnote 2 permits alternative initial channels fails because its text requires resubmission without granting permission or retrospective cure. Extending footnote 3 to the web form likewise lacks an anchor. The strongest remaining uncertainty is the operational meaning of satisfying the certificate requirement.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor belongs to one of the classes collectively called licensed firms.","name":"is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The event is an actual STR filing to the JFIU.","name":"is_str_filing","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean event classification"},{"meaning":"The filing occurs at or after the 9:00am operational launch on 2026-02-02.","name":"at_or_after_operational_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean temporal classification"},{"meaning":"The filing is made through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel classification"},{"meaning":"The selected event submits an STR in XML format; this identifies the method without asserting schema conformity.","name":"is_xml_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean method classification"},{"meaning":"The XML submission conforms to the separately provided JFIU XML schema.","name":"xml_schema_conforms","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean technical conformity assessment"},{"meaning":"The selected method is a completed prescribed PDF upload.","name":"is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean method classification"},{"meaning":"The selected method is completion of the STREAMS 2 web form.","name":"is_completed_streams2_web_form","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean method classification"},{"meaning":"The footnote 3 Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement is met for the assessed XML or PDF submission.","name":"submission_ecert_requirement_met","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean certificate-requirement assessment"}],"result":"(and via_streams2 (or (and is_xml_submission xml_schema_conforms submission_ecert_requirement_met) (and is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload submission_ecert_requirement_met) is_completed_streams2_web_form))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_licensed_firm is_str_filing at_or_after_operational_launch)"},"local_id":"channel_control_with_attached_qualifications","questions":["What technical evidence can establish the certificate and schema assessment facts without assuming their conclusions?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, true means the selected filing satisfies the STREAMS 2 channel, listed-method, XML-schema and applicable e-Cert control. False means that selected control is not satisfied. Later resubmission does not change the original event's result under this proposal.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, method and certificate control"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.583a0a4d40d9fa690cc9a445","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"4b2c98a842d4fb701db1f1c5b554fa7c5eb66ef803ce7c049a63156e8d779530","candidate_id":"candidate.2f564c6967b348a390efb311bc0775c4","commitment":"8c5e0d91275b795d477f791334e493d7579cb342483264ed3e4a6e4a28814dc6","depth":1,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.8c5e0d91275b795d477f7913","order":15,"parent":"node.583a0a4d40d9fa690cc9a445","reading":{"assumptions":["Following implementation is interpreted as at or after operational launch.","The result concerns the selected submission event, not the complete submission history of an STR.","Unknown facts remain unknown; contact is not assumed to be filing.","No deadline, discharge condition or permission to file off-channel is inferred."],"citations":[{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"This complementary reading makes footnote 2's attachment explicit as a separate event-level trigger. An off-channel post-launch filing can fail the initial channel control and trigger mandatory resubmission simultaneously. A false result for this event does not exclude a qualifying event elsewhere in the same report's history. Implementation's precise boundary remains the strongest textual uncertainty.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor belongs to one of the classes collectively called licensed firms.","name":"is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The event is an actual STR filing to the JFIU.","name":"is_str_filing","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean event classification"},{"meaning":"The filing occurs at or after the 9:00am operational launch on 2026-02-02.","name":"at_or_after_operational_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean temporal classification"},{"meaning":"The filing is made through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel classification"}],"result":"(and at_or_after_operational_launch (not via_streams2))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_licensed_firm is_str_filing)"},"local_id":"separate_resubmission_trigger","questions":["Does implementation expressly coincide with operational launch?","What evidence and guidance establish completion or lateness of the resulting resubmission duty?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within scope, true means the selected event triggers the separate STREAMS 2 resubmission obligation under the operational-launch assumption. False means that event does not meet this trigger. Neither value determines whether resubmission is outstanding, discharged or overdue.","subject":"Event-level trigger for mandatory resubmission"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.583a0a4d40d9fa690cc9a445","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.d8b26f226c2e4b87a2c149214e86e8a6","commitment":"ffbffced8482e825ba2e9b76b14cf55688c6df9e78cbc933fe6feb48da88a5aa","depth":1,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE","details":"None"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.ffbffced8482e825ba2e9b76","order":16,"parent":"node.583a0a4d40d9fa690cc9a445","reading":{"assumptions":["The blackout begins at 12:00am on 28 January 2026 and ends when submissions resume at 9:00am on 2 February 2026.","The urgent-contact direction retains its please wording under the transitional should provision.","Pre-launch blackout contact is not treated as a post-implementation filing."],"citations":[{"quote":"Licensed firms should observe the JFIU’s transitional arrangements as set out below:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614"},{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"}],"distinction":"The blackout arrangement attaches to urgency during a bounded interval, not to urgency at any time. It therefore does not supply a continuing post-launch exception. A hypothesis that every listed contact method completes filing or automatically triggers footnote 2 lacks support. The source does not settle follow-up for blackout-only submissions.","family":"exceptions","formalization":null,"local_id":"bounded_blackout_contact","questions":["What constitutes completed urgent filing through the blackout arrangements, and what later follow-up is required?"],"statement":"For an STR requiring urgent submission during the blackout, licensed firms are directed to contact JFIU through a listed email, phone or fax method. This instruction remains separate from the post-launch channel control and does not establish that contact alone completes filing.","subject":"Urgent blackout contact and its limited attachment"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.583a0a4d40d9fa690cc9a445","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0}],"pending":null,"provider_id":"codex.fresh.v1.compact.v1","retrievals":[{"missing_dependencies":["missing.39ffa0d54487ee68b17a36b8","missing.da4d23ff33f664a99e4bf8cc","missing.f5f807738efdd34996b25ddc","missing.1557ee52aade13863ae98bda"],"node_id":"node.583a0a4d40d9fa690cc9a445","retained_uncited_units":[{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 0:381","normative":true,"span":{"end":381,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u0.0","page":1,"quote_sha256":"93a6b160d32f2917044310722dbbaa750b9621b2026b1716d218281315fa8699","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":0,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”) about the logistical arrangements for transitioning to the Joint Financial Intelligence Unit’s (JFIU) new suspicious transaction reporting platform by 2 February 2026.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 383:793","normative":true,"span":{"end":793,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u1.383","page":1,"quote_sha256":"5b80c009d85923938c65f2f01261336f7a31448def44ff09d2962f95e79ddad7","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":383,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"The JFIU has developed the new platform, the Suspicious Transaction Report and Management System 2 (STREAMS 2)1, which will replace the current STREAMS platform. By enhancing system automation and analytical capabilities, the new platform increases the efficiency and effectiveness of the JFIU’s analysis and dissemination of financial intelligence gathered from suspicious transaction reports (STRs) received.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u1.383"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 795:809","normative":true,"span":{"end":809,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u2.795","page":1,"quote_sha256":"41da443ea16d3bb6ed1ba9f1c3f46f6c06468e9f93c838af1376c1f53b028c9e","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":795,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"STR submission","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u2.795"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1003:1076","normative":true,"span":{"end":1076,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","page":1,"quote_sha256":"3e17bb7e53881757283cf457076dc1a8167fceb00c41b650f746d2b857f78aa7","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1003,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"(a)  submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1078:1147","normative":true,"span":{"end":1147,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","page":1,"quote_sha256":"632cd50963d86bbef0bf0edcefbc92e62f2963e69cd23f99585da2398373c81e","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1078,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"(b)  uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1149:1201","normative":true,"span":{"end":1201,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","page":1,"quote_sha256":"bbf00079d48dab7e5c6fb77f0498f9408ab9e3a5c5d2bfbc93994bc94378a87f","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1149,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"(c)  completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1203:1233","normative":true,"span":{"end":1233,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u7.1203","page":1,"quote_sha256":"92de073146674e118d8ce3ef1def92158cbd88dc525dd004f9016b495883f217","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1203,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"STREAMS 2 account registration","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u7.1203"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1235:1578","normative":true,"span":{"end":1578,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","page":1,"quote_sha256":"d0c2e8355c54597621c3fb2eed785cdd7fb6def40c471859c39b78665b86f9a0","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1235,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"Licensed firms should register STREAMS 2 user accounts to facilitate the prompt submission of STRs. For new user registration, please download the STREAMS 2 User Registration Form available on the JFIU website (https://www.jfiu.gov.hk/info/doc/STREAMS_2_Reg_form.docx), and submit the completed form to the JFIU via email (jfiu@police.gov.hk).","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u8.1235"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1580:1612","normative":true,"span":{"end":1612,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u9.1580","page":1,"quote_sha256":"d4bc5e4c2f1658f40cec29f5139c4a948f64265afb837a963defbf675d5dc4f5","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1580,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"System transitional arrangements","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u9.1580"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1614:1698","normative":true,"span":{"end":1698,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","page":1,"quote_sha256":"9ce7f9f59ff7a8feff58acae39fafa9aa779867f7299f1e395f41439b5a6eddb","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1614,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"Licensed firms should observe the JFIU’s transitional arrangements as set out below:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1700:1939","normative":true,"span":{"end":1939,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","page":1,"quote_sha256":"8113466ae39a17b68037319d9f35141a9e909fa6120c1bea1ebbf1f4f77fd0db","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1700,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"(a)  the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2 (hereafter referred to as the “blackout period of STREAMS”);","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 1941:2129","normative":true,"span":{"end":2129,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","page":1,"quote_sha256":"abd48d74a13a02bfe4ab0ec73a285c1fd110b2da755aa4725cd5aa4601d29f48","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1941,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"(b)  for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 2439:2672","normative":true,"span":{"end":2672,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","page":1,"quote_sha256":"e0761230f09b76ec387626e937478e87994b8b36a4ae2177a009403ec73fd48c","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":2439,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"(d)  licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU and liaise with it as soon as possible to arrange a technical test to ensure a smooth transition.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 2675:2850","normative":true,"span":{"end":2850,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u15.2675","page":1,"quote_sha256":"d156a428917b21b31df7fceab87bdb4173384c4599a818cecbac011dd4fbe820","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":2675,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"Should you have any queries regarding the contents of this circular, please contact the JFIU’s Senior Inspector Mr Owen Tse at 3660 0533 or by email (owencytse@police.gov.hk).","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u15.2675"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 2852:2875","normative":true,"span":{"end":2875,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u16.2852","page":1,"quote_sha256":"9b5b81506e6b64492c143b14fff4eeee4d17eef11e4a9aa5275b47e35195e2f2","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":2852,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"Intermediaries Division","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u16.2852"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 2879:2912","normative":true,"span":{"end":2912,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u18.2879","page":1,"quote_sha256":"88e2bc94e9edc39f2ac1cdaaea86b44ab5ea59b31c446f69591f21bf460b005e","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":2879,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"Securities and Futures Commission","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u18.2879"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 2914:2917","normative":true,"span":{"end":2917,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u19.2914","page":1,"quote_sha256":"f4db1e48476f60753980b10d66219042b3a3d9c65c9cc77a53d81b88fd869c64","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":2914,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},"text":"End","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u19.2914"},{"locator":"https://apps.sfc.hk/edistributionWeb/gateway/EN/circular/doc?refNo=26EC2 chars 2919:2934","normative":true,"span":{"end":2934,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u20.2919","p